---@field time_period? github.repos.GetOrgRuleSuitesRequestTimePeriod|string The time period to filter by. For example, `day` will filter for rule suites that occurred in the past 24 hours, and `week` will filter for rule suites that occurred in the past 7 days (168 hours).
