---@field evaluate_status? github.repos.GetOrgRuleSuitesRequestEvaluateStatus|string The evaluate status to filter on. When specified, only rule suites resulting from rulesets with the specified evaluate status will be returned. - `all` - all rule suites will be returned. - `active` - only rule suites resulting from rulesets in active (non-evaluate) mode will be returned. - `evaluate` - only rule suites resulting from rulesets in evaluate mode will be returned.
