---Merges must be performed via a merge queue.
---@class github.repos.RepositoryRuleMergeQueue
---@field type github.repos.RepositoryRuleMergeQueueType|string
---@field parameters? github.repos.RepositoryRuleMergeQueueParameters

---@class github.repos.RepositoryRuleMergeQueueParameters
